# CODEOWNERS — review ownership by area.
#
# Referenced by docs/governance/SECURITY.md ("reports about deployment go to
# CODEOWNERS for deployment/") and GOVERNANCE.md §1/§3 (a limit or contract
# change needs the owning reviewer). GitHub requires a review from every
# matching owner before a PR to a protected branch can merge; the last
# matching pattern wins.
#
# Roles, not individuals: replace each handle with the team that holds it in
# your organisation. The names below mirror the ownership the governance docs
# already assume.
#
#   @iap/platform  platform + deployment + observability + CI
#   @iap/risk      hard risk engine, limits, kill switches
#   @iap/core      market data, order book, codecs, replay
#   @iap/execution execution simulator, SOR, algos, TCA
#   @iap/research  features, alphas, models, adaptability, papers
#   @iap/docs      specification, contracts, runbooks

# ------------------------------------------------------------- default ------
*                                   @iap/platform

